{
  "id": "561",
  "title": "Used Bed For Sale",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2018-08-08",
  "synopsis": "Little Wang puts up an advertisement for his used bed.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/803/f55dd6be73ef7fc358111f24569302136f90509c.mp3?1532935042",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "二手床出售\n\n    现有一黑色单人床出售，2017年购于宜家，八成新。床长211厘米，宽102厘米，高94厘米。原价849元，现400元出，不带床垫。床在北京朝阳区，需自提。\n    有意者请联系：13650503693 小王",
    "traditional": "二手床出售\n\n    現有一黑色單人床出售，2017年購於宜家，八成新。床長211釐米，寬102釐米，高94釐米。原價849元，現400元出，不帶床墊。床在北京朝陽區，需自提。\n    有意者請聯繫：13650503693 小王"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Used Bed For Sale"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "现有一黑色单人床出售，2017年购于宜家，八成新。",
      "traditional": "現有一黑色單人床出售，2017年購於宜家，八成新。",
      "pinyin": "xiàn yǒu yì hēi sè dān rén chuáng chū shòu 4 nián gòu yú yí jiā bā chéng xīn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "床长211厘米，宽102厘米，高94厘米。",
      "traditional": "床長211釐米，寬102釐米，高94釐米。",
      "pinyin": "chuáng cháng 5 lí mǐ kuān 4 lí mǐ gāo 3 lí mǐ",
      "english": "One black single bed now for sale. Bought at IKEA in 2017. 80% new."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "原价849元，现400元出，不带床垫。",
      "traditional": "原價849元，現400元出，不帶床墊。",
      "pinyin": "yuán jià 5 yuán xiàn 2 yuán chū bú dài chuáng diàn",
      "english": "Bed length 211 cm, width 102 cm, height 94 cm."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "床在北京朝阳区，需自提。",
      "traditional": "床在北京朝陽區，需自提。",
      "pinyin": "chuáng zài běi jīng cháo yáng qū xū zì tí",
      "english": "Original price 849 yuan, now selling for 400 yuan. Does not include mattress."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The bed is in the Beijing Chaoyang district. Customer pick-up."
    },
    {
